{BobPK, BobSK} = libsodium_crypto_box_curve25519xchacha20poly1305:keypair(),
Nonce = libsodium_randombytes:buf(libsodium_crypto_box_curve25519xchacha20poly1305:noncebytes()),
Ciphertext = libsodium_crypto_box_curve25519xchacha20poly1305:easy(<<"message">>, Nonce, BobPK, AliceSK),
<<"message">> = libsodium_crypto_box_curve25519xchacha20poly1305:open_easy(Ciphertext, Nonce, AlicePK, BobSK).
```
""".
